Dependencies beyond base, bytestring, containers and the one
cryptography library, and what needs each.

    crypton      the cryptography library: SHA-256, Ed25519, X25519,
                 AES-256-CBC, HMAC-SHA-256

    bzlib        a resource carries its data compressed when that is
                 shorter, and this is the decompressor

    network      the TCP interface's socket, and the address it is
                 dialled at

    time         the node's clock: the five bytes of unix time an
                 announce carries, and the expiry of a path

    memory       crypton hands back digests and keys as ByteArray, and
                 Data.ByteArray.convert is the way to a ByteString.
                 The harness reads and writes hex through
                 Data.ByteArray.Encoding.

    stm          the node's tables are one value behind one lock, and
                 what changes two of them changes them together
